cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Batang, please cite it as below, and also cite the original
  datasets you use (see DATASETS.md).
title: "Batang: an open hub for battery data, simulation and AI modeling"
abstract: >-
  Batang (바탕, "foundation" in Korean): the foundation for every battery
  experiment, model and insight. An open hub for battery research that
  standardizes public cycling and fault datasets record by record into one
  Parquet schema (unified units, cycle segmentation, cycle kinds, a single SOH
  definition), and builds on it physics-based cell simulation (PyBaMM) and AI
  modeling (data preprocessing, block-built models, GPU training and
  evaluation), offered through a web hub, a Python package and a remote MCP
  server.
type: software
authors:
